ch erwachtest du je,"],[43.26,45.353,"Mime","nirgends w\u00e4r\u2019 ich sicher vor dir,"],[45.56,47.746,"Mime","h\u00e4tt\u2019 ich selbst auch den Ring."],[48.48,49.973,"Mime","Drum mit dem Schwert,"],[50.386,51.7,"Mime","das so scharf du schufst,"],[51.88,53.801,"Mime","hau\u2019 ich dem Kind den Kopf erst ab:"],[54.193,56.573,"Mime","dann hab\u2019 ich mir Ruh\u2019 und auch den Ring! \u2013"],[56.573,58.679,"Mime","Hi hi hi hi hi hi hi hi hi hi hi!"],[58.68,61.632,"Mime","Sauf\u2019, und w\u00fcrg dich zu tot!"],[62.542,66.038,"Mime","Nie tust du mehr \u2019nen Schluck! \u2013 hi hi hi hi hi!"],[66.04,70.288,"Siegfried","Schmeck du mein Schwert, ekliger Schw\u00e4tzer!"],[69.485,72.878,"Alberich","Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!"],[85.75,87.64,"Siegfried","Neides Zoll zahlt Nothung:"]],"notes":[[0.0,0.3178,81,39,0],[0.0,2.7163,64,39,1],[0.0748,0.243,85,39,0],[0.149,0.1688,88,39,0],[0.1589,0.1615,69,39,1],[0.2238,0.094,93,39,0],[0.3178,0.1615,73,39,1],[0.4767,0.1615,69,39,1],[0.6356,0.1615,73,39,1],[0.7944,0.1615,69,39,1],[0.9533,0.1615,73,39,1],[0.9533,0.9533,78,61,0],[0.9533,0.9533,90,61,0],[1.1122,0.1615,69,39,1],[1.2711,0.1615,73,39,1],[1.43,0.1615,69,39,1],[1.5889,0.1615,73,39,1],[1.7478,0.1615,69,39,1],[1.9067,0.1589,88,61,0],[1.9067,0.1615,73,39,1],[2.0656,0.1615,69,39,1],[2.2244,0.1615,73,39,1],[2.2244,0.4767,85,61,0],[2.3833,0.1615,69,39,1],[2.5422,0.1615,73,39,1],[2.7011,0.0794,83,61,0],[2.7011,0.149,69,39,1],[2.86,0.1475,81,61,0],[2.86,0.15,73,39,1],[2.86,2.5216,64,39,1],[3.0075,0.15,69,39,1],[3.155,0.1475,78,61,0],[3.155,0.15,73,39,1],[3.3025,0.15,69,39,1],[3.45,0.1475,81,61,0],[3.45,0.15,73,39,1],[3.5975,0.15,69,39,1],[3.745,0.1475,85,61,0],[3.745,0.15,73,39,1],[3.8925,0.15,69,39,1],[4.04,0.1475,81,61,0],[4.04,0.15,73,39,1],[4.1875,0.15,69,39,1],[4.335,0.1475,85,61,0],[4.335,0.15,73,39,1],[4.4825,0.15,69,39,1],[4.63,0.15,73,39,1],[4.63,0.15,81,61,0],[4.63,0.6017,88,61,0],[4.7775,0.15,71,39,1],[4.7775,0.15,80,61,0],[4.925,0.15,73,39,1],[4.925